				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45039e27-dd35-459d-9105-6ae205c6aba5")
	)
	(text "Same Sky CMT-5023S-SMT: 3 V, 4 kHz, 110 mA, 80 dB at 10 cm.\nP1.05 switches it through Q1; R7 holds Q1 off while\nthe pin floats; D3 clamps the coil when Q1 opens.\nOn the front over J1, so the clip's jaw rests on it.\nJP1 (bridged) and C3 (not fitted) are on the back: cut JP1,\nfit 2.2 to 4.7 Ω and C3 to keep BZ1's pulses off the supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.71 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5dfe76dd-57df-58b1-8001-db2600285d9c")
	)
